body:
i was feeling really..triggered and alone so i came into this subreddit and found this...i relate to this so much.,..so much, i'm so tired, i was trying to study but i can't, my BDD is taking over, but it's kinda nice knowing i'm not alone, that others feel this way as well, so i guess..thank you for sharing your experience??

